Task: The layout from source/
Lay out the tag structures with clang for 32-bit MSVC into engine/census/tag_layout.tsv

The census needs every tag field's offset as the original's compiler placed it, so it can say which fields the original reads, the importer keeps and the engine uses. clang -cc1 for i686-pc-windows-msvc dumps the record layout of the 197 structures in source/'s *_definitions.h; census --write records them and --check regenerates and compares (skipped without clang).

Checked: every sizeof and offsetof assert in the headers agrees with the written layout; tests on a fake definitions header, the dump parser and malformed input; 48 census tests pass; census --check passes.
